            <div class="feature-row"><span class="feat-icon">✓</span><div><strong>9 Kapitel</strong> + Bonus-Kapitel</div></div>
            <div class="feature-row"><span class="feat-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Workbook</strong> — digital &amp; physisch per Post</div></div>
            <div class="feature-row"><span class="feat-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Telegram-Gruppe</strong> — Austausch mit anderen Paaren</div></div>
            <div class="feature-row"><span class="feat-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Live Call</strong> mit Annette &amp; Herbert</div></div>
